## NEW DEFINITIONS & AXIOMS

**New Definition:**
- `Def_HybridAggregation`: Incremental learning gated by outcome.confidence >= 0.7 + recency_decay λ=0.1/day

**New Definition:**
- `Def_OutcomeConfidence`: outcome.confidence = phase_confidence × avg(finding_confidence) ∈ [0,1]

**New Axiom:**
- `Ax_LearningConfidenceGate`: Only outcomes with confidence >= 0.7 affect pattern weights in compute_adaptive_strategy()

